$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Beta Zolari IX" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n<f1>Max Bases: <f0> 2/5" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Beta Zolari IX is a remote but hospitable world and it has become a popular place to refuel during missions across deep space.  Both the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes have stopped here in hopes of purchasing fuel from this small space port situated in the pit of an ancient meteor crater.  Instead the dropship crews of these tribes discovered that there had been an accident and all of the fuel stored here had been burned.  Two other tribes needed to get off this planet and what meager fuel your two tribes had was all there was.  After a bloody battle both crews of the ships already stranded here were slain.  But not without a price, several high ranking officers who were catching a ride on your ship were killed, along with the ship's navigator and pilot!  Now the only surviving person with the navigational knowledge necessary to get you home is your dropship Captain!\n\nDefend your dropship Captain while attempting to kill your enemy's.  The first team to kill the enemy's Captain shall be the victor!";
